vdr-plugin-text2skin packaging
==============================

The branch debian/trixie of https://github.com/unf/vdr-plugin-text2skin
holds the Debian packaging on top of the upstream tag v<version>. master
stays plain upstream source.

Build with git-buildpackage, the orig tarball is created from the tag:

  git clone https://github.com/unf/vdr-plugin-text2skin.git
  cd vdr-plugin-text2skin
  git checkout debian/trixie
  gbp buildpackage

The package needs vdr-dev (>= 2.8.3-4fnu0~) of the VDR it is built for.

 -- Frank Neumann <fnu@vdr-portal.de>
